WEBVTT

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:01.268
about how to have more fun.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.062
I looked at some of these myself,

00:08:03.103 --> 00:08:06.482
and I found suggestions that include --
and I'm not making these up --

00:08:06.482 --> 00:08:07.733
"roast a turkey."

00:08:07.775 --> 00:08:10.736
(Laughter)

00:08:10.778 --> 00:08:13.322
"Put together an altar
to loved ones who have passed."

00:08:13.322 --> 00:08:16.492
(Laughter)

00:08:16.951 --> 00:08:19.787
“Watch a documentary
about climate change.”

00:08:19.828 --> 00:08:23.374
(Laughter)

00:08:23.374 --> 00:08:24.708
And my personal favorite,

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.418
"Adorn your table with gourds."

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.836
(Laughter)

00:08:27.836 --> 00:08:32.174
Those are not good suggestions.